# Basic layer turns on a 3x3x3: one drag per face and direction, slices, notation.
# Drags run between sticker centres, so their direction is exact in world space.
cuboid 3x3x3

case 1.1 Drag F right column up
note R: right layer turns clockwise seen from R (front column goes up)
wait 0.4
drag F@2,-2,2 F@2,2,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn R
expect state R

case 1.2 Drag F right column down
note R': the same layer the other way
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@2,2,2 F@2,-2,2 0.5
settle
expect state R'

case 1.3 Drag F left column down
note L: left layer clockwise seen from L (shown as its R-axis name 3R')
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@-2,2,2 F@-2,-2,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn 3R'
expect state L

case 1.4 Drag F top row left
note U: top layer clockwise seen from above
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@2,2,2 F@-2,2,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn U
expect state U

case 1.5 Drag F bottom row right
note D: bottom layer clockwise seen from below (3U')
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@-2,-2,2 F@2,-2,2 0.5
settle
expect state D

case 1.6 Drag U front row right
note F: front layer clockwise seen from the front
reset
wait 0.4
drag U@-2,2,2 U@2,2,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn F
expect state F

case 1.7 Drag R front column down
note F again, grabbed on the R face: front layer clockwise
reset
wait 0.4
drag R@2,2,2 R@2,-2,2 0.5
settle
expect state F

case 1.8 Drag U back row left
note B: back layer clockwise seen from behind (3F')
reset
wait 0.4
drag U@2,2,-2 U@-2,2,-2 0.5
settle
expect state B

case 1.9 Drag F middle column up
note 2R: middle slice turned like R
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@0,-2,2 F@0,2,2 0.5
settle
expect feedback turn 2R
expect state 2R

case 1.10 Drag F middle row left
note 2U: equator slice turned like U
reset
wait 0.4
drag F@2,0,2 F@-2,0,2 0.5
settle
expect state 2U

case 1.11 Drag U middle row right
note 2F: standing slice turned like F
reset
wait 0.4
drag U@-2,2,0 U@2,2,0 0.5
settle
expect state 2F

case 1.12 Notation input "R U R' U'"
note Four queued turns animate one after another
reset
wait 0.4
moves R U R' U'
settle
expect state R U R' U'

case 1.13 Notation input "R2 U2"
note Half turns animate as one 180 degree turn each
reset
wait 0.4
moves R2 U2
settle
expect state R2 U2
